swer\", \"text\": \"The structural details mentioned in municipal documents suit close observation of local craftsmanship; it is not known whether all of them can be seen from outside. Boat parts identified by sources as being on the temple grounds provide a link to the town's waterborne goods transport. There is no recent condition report for 2026 (B.E. 2569)\"}}]}]",
