องพระฝ่ายอรัญวาสี และมีอายุประมาณ 200 ปี ชาวบ้านเรียกวัดนี้ว่า ‘วัดลุ่ม’ เพราะตั้งอยู่ในพื้นที่ลาดลุ่ม\"}}, {\"@type\": \"Question\", \"name\": \"มีจุดเด่นอะไรให้ชม\", \"acceptedAnswer\": {\"@type\": \"Answer\", \"text\": \"ฐานเจดีย์โบราณที่มีต้นไทรใหญ่ขึ้นอยู่บนฐาน เป็นศูนย์รวมศรัทธาสำคัญของชุมชนตามข้อมูลเทศบาล ประดิษฐานอยู่ภายในวัด\"}}]}]": "[{\"@context\": \"https://schema.org\", \"@type\": \"BreadcrumbList\", \"itemListElement\": [{\"@type\": \"ListItem\", \"position\": 1, \"name\": \"Home\", \"item\": \"https://takuapa101.pages.dev/\"}, {\"@type\": \"ListItem\", \"position\": 2, \"name\": \"Wat Boromthat Khiri Khet (Wat Lum)\", \"item\": \"https://takuapa101.pages.dev/places/wat-boromthat/\"}]}, {\"@context\": \"https://schema.org\", \"@type\": \"TouristAttraction\", \"name\": \"Wat Boromthat Khiri Khet (Wat Lum)\", \"url\": \"https://takuapa101.pages.dev/places/wat-boromthat/\", \"image\": \"https://takuapa101.pages.dev/assets/wat-boromthat.webp\", \"description\": \"The temple houses relics of the Buddha and is an important place of faith\", \"address\": {\"@type\": \"PostalAddress\", \"streetAddress\": \"Thanon Klan Kaew, Old Market area (around Soi Khiri Khet)\", \"addressLocality\": \"Takuapa\", \"addressRegion\": \"Phang Nga\", \"postalCode\": \"82110\", \"addressCountry\": \"TH\"}, \"geo\": {\"@type\": \"GeoCoordinates\", \"latitude\": 8.8336680169, \"longitude\": 98.3563150443}}, {\"@context\": \"https://schema.org\", \"@type\": \"FAQPage\", \"mainEntity\": [{\"@type\": \"Question\", \"name\": \"What are the opening hours?\", \"acceptedAnswer\": {\"@type\": \"Answer\", \"text\": \"Not verified · Daily 08.00·17.00\"}}, {\"@type\": \"Question\", \"name\": \"Is there an admission fee?\", \"acceptedAnswer\": {\"@type\": \"Answer\", \"text\": \"Not verified · No admission fee\"}}, {\"@type\": \"Question\", \"name\": \"How should I dress?\", \"acceptedAnswer\": {\"@type\": \"Answer\", \"text\": \"Dress respectfully when visiting a religious site\"}}, {\"@type\": \"Question\", \"name\": \"How do I get there from Takuapa town centre?\", \"acceptedAnswer\": {\"@type\": \"Answer\", \"text\": \"Head to Takuapa Old Town, then take Thanon Klan Kaew or Soi Khiri Khet\"}}, {\"@type\": \"Question\", \"name\": \"What is the history of this place?\", \"acceptedAnswer\": {\"@type\": \"Answer\", \"text\": \"It was originally a forest-dwelling monks' retreat and is around 200 years old. Locals call it Wat Lum because it stands on low-lying ground\"}}, {\"@type\": \"Question\", \"name\": \"What is there to see?\", \"acceptedAnswer\": {\"@type\": \"Answer\", \"text\": \"An ancient chedi base with a large banyan tree growing on it. Municipal information identifies it as an important focus of community faith, located within the temple\"}}]}]",
