\": \"Question\", \"name\": \"How do I get there from Takua Pa town?\", \"acceptedAnswer\": {\"@type\": \"Answer\", \"text\": \"Take Thanon Rat Bamrung into the old town, then continue along Thanon Si Takua Pa; the walking street is around Thanon Si Takua Pa and Thanon Udom Thara\"}}, {\"@type\": \"Question\", \"name\": \"What is the history of this place?\", \"acceptedAnswer\": {\"@type\": \"Answer\", \"text\": \"Buildings in the old town preserve traces of Sino-Portuguese and Sino-Takua Pa architecture associated with the tin-mining era\"}}, {\"@type\": \"Question\", \"name\": \"What is there to see?\", \"acceptedAnswer\": {\"@type\": \"Answer\", \"text\": \"Sino-Portuguese houses and shophouses in the old town, local dishes, traditional snacks and local food, cultural performances, local games, and Baba-style clothing\"}}]}]"
